    "created_at": "2016-03-17T06:31:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-17T06:31:26Z",
    "body": "Oh, I guess navigation does explicitly mutate the \"window\" of the settings context.  So ok, the main inconsistency is between that and `document.open`.\n",
