    "created_at": "2016-03-17T14:41:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-17T14:41:42Z",
    "body": "It seems like I unintentionally messed things up a while back. Today I will work on reverting to having environment settings objects and realms be 1:1 with globals. See https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/322#issuecomment-197697589 for a bit more.\n",
